# Who must review what, in this wiki.
#
# Deliberately narrow. Requiring a human on every capture would defeat the
# point of a tool designed to log without friction, so routine entity changes
# are gated by the validation workflow rather than by a person.
#
# Only the files that define the shape of everything else need an owner: a bad
# schema or vocabulary change is expensive to unpick, and cheap to catch here.

CONVENTIONS.md   @anurag14-10
MASTERS.md       @anurag14-10

# Note that `staging/` is intentionally absent. Sensed candidates are reviewed
# by whoever owns the affected entity, in conversation with the skill, not by a
# file-pattern rule -- see references/staging.md in the skill.
